      "writtenOn": "2024-02-01T15:00:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@lorenzo@google.com\nCould you help to review this method which handles carrier privilege lost?\nEspecially I\u0027m not so sure if it\u0027s ok to post `EVENT_NETWORK_CAPABILITIES_CHANGED` with internal networkCapabilities from ConnectivityService. But I\u0027m not sure if we have better way to update networkCapabilities.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9103,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 9103,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "0b4f5cdf8d7e76c7370627852812ccc2ca51c314",
