      "writtenOn": "2024-02-01T15:00:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel this test is strange, I don\u0027t think mCarrierConfigPkgUid loses the CarrierPrivilege since packageManager#getApplicationInfo still returns mCarrierConfigPkgUid.\nMaybe we don\u0027t have this case on the real device?\nI think this is related to my comment on `simConfigChanged`",
